    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custodes of Elf Hearts is a lewd tower defense game featuring beautiful elf girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305840/extras/b7e32c0d8081cc7f220f35d2b8f0ae26.avif?t=1754665469\" width=616 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Story&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a half human, half-elf, the player is a member of an underground organization that resides in the lower levels of the World Tree, secretly maintaining peace in the impoverished district beneath its roots. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, a traitor within the ranks has led to a disastrous outbreak of black sludge like creatures, corrupting their homeland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To resolve this crisis, the protagonist receives divine guidance from a goddess and sets out on a journey alongside various elf maidens to thwart the ambitions of the mastermind behind it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305840/extras/1584d4903485bfbfbf2752d1f14e8984.poster.avif?t=1754665469\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305840/extras/1584d4903485bfbfbf2752d1f14e8984.webm?t=1754665469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305840/extras/1584d4903485bfbfbf2752d1f14e8984.mp4?t=1754665469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the fertility of male elves in decline, the protagonist being a half human has suddenly become a highly sought-after target?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a lighthearted and humorous daily life narrative, paired with blush inducing, heart pounding CG events and dynamic visual experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305840/extras/2dd189832c3055ccaaafe9a1037155f0.poster.avif?t=1754665469\" width=616 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305840/extras/2dd189832c3055ccaaafe9a1037155f0.webm?t=1754665469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&lt;Tower Defense Combat&gt;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character represents a tower, with unique stats and abilities. By spending resources during battles, they can be upgraded and unleash powerful skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, the Goddess is more than just a decoration\u2014she possesses a divine skill that heals all allied units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, the enemy Sludge also comes in various forms with tricky abilities. It\u2019s up to the player to carefully strategize and deploy the right units to counter them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305840/extras/500fe2484d9f483cd5de61e5d9777872.poster.avif?t=1754665469\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305840/extras/500fe2484d9f483cd5de61e5d9777872.webm?t=1754665469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305840/extras/500fe2484d9f483cd5de61e5d9777872.mp4?t=1754665469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >&lt;Lewd Elf Heroines&gt;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 6 elf girls with whom you can develop deeper relationships. Each has her own stunning figure and unique personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elena</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Junior assassin in the organization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personality:</strong> The protagonist's direct subordinate in the organization; recognized the protagonist as her master after being adopted by him; typically cold and aloof (towards people other than the protagonist).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305840/extras/83576656035bdf808025d758fd7cd188.avif?t=1754665469\" width=200 height=320 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lesia</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Owner of a brothel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personality:</strong> An older unmarried woman (old in terms of the age of elves, but still very beautiful), loves money (and sperms), likes to do experiments, and likes young male humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305840/extras/11a2d3efe3c25b292dd929f7fba53e22.avif?t=1754665469\" width=200 height=320 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alice</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captain of the Princess's Escort</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personality:</strong> Very arrogant noblewoman; treats anyone other than those she respects with disdain; looks down on the weak, but secretly enjoys being humiliated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305840/extras/fbb8b61be763ec1fb671138d40abe9e5.avif?t=1754665469\" width=200 height=320 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elfe Stamana</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seventh-generation princess to inherit the name &quot;Elfe&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personality:</strong> Cheerful and simple-minded girl; has excellent martial skills; a very straightforward woman, not overly modest despite being a princess, and can quickly get along with those around her; occasionally shows a delicate side despite usually being sensible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305840/extras/93a19d1018337076694d1584217ea8dc.avif?t=1754665469\" width=200 height=320 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mellie</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Captured slave and modified human</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personality:</strong> Rarely shows emotion or speaks much but still has her own opinions. After joining the team, she views the protagonist as the leader and calls him &quot;Master&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305840/extras/b13158bc6da9e875dbd668dc08e965d0.avif?t=1754665469\" width=200 height=320 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elfe Anastasia</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goddess of the world tree, first queen of Elfland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personality:</strong> Considered to be everyone's mother; a very easygoing goddess who truly loves her children and values promises. Occasionally playful, with a somewhat of a silly big sister vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3305840/extras/3ad25a2434c34a535760daf953936e79.avif?t=1754665469\" width=200 height=320 /></span></p>",
